  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transforming city region food systems by reducing food loss and waste in local food production and supply systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance the capacity of national and local institutions, as well as various actors involved in local food production and supply systems, with particular focus on smallholder producers, to effectively manage food loss and waste through prevention, reduction, reuse, and recycling measures, ultimately contributing to improved food security and nutrition.</narrative>
  </description>
